        - Input: :math:`(N, C)` or :math:`(C)`, where :math:`N` is the batch size and :math:`C` is the number of classes.
        - Target: :math:`(N)` or :math:`()`, where each value is :math:`0 \leq \text{targets}[i] \leq C-1`.
